{"id":"n55498-1-7","stage":5,"title":"모유 · 母乳","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55498-1-7-1","ko":"유민 씨는 딸에게 모유를 주세요?","zh":"裕敏女士是在给女儿喂母乳吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏。","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨는","audio":"/audio/1e98662e92cdd5672d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"딸에게","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딸에게","audio":"/audio/6641fb2efafd07b738cf.mp3"}},{"text":"모유를","meaning":"母乳","explanation":"모유：母乳；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"모유","audio":"/audio/0d4d03ef47b5ed530e01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55498","senseId":"1","lemma":"모유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모유를","audio":"/audio/df232dc007508a7041c8.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요?","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"3